{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_228_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春，王正月，邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"二、鼷鼠食郊牛，牛死，改卜牛。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"不敬莫大焉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"三、二月，辛丑，楚子滅胡，以胡子豹歸。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"四、夏，五月，辛亥，郊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"五、壬申，公薨於高寢。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"高寢，非正也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"六、鄭罕達帥師伐宋。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"七、齊侯、衞侯次於渠蒢。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"八、邾子來奔喪。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"喪急，故以奔言之。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"九、秋，七月，壬申，弋氏卒。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"妾辭也，哀公之母也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"十、八月，庚辰，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"十一、九月，滕子來會葬。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"十二、丁巳，葬我君定公，雨，不克葬。戊午，日下稷，乃克葬。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"葬既有日，不為雨止，禮也。雨不克葬，喪不以制也。乃，急辭也，不足乎日之辭也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"十三、辛巳，葬定弋。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_clt_228_19","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_228","textTraditional":"十四、冬，城漆。","sentenceOrder":19}],"overrides":{}}